    "title": "Objectives",
    "text": "objectives\n\nExtract key medical information from records, including dates of service, providers, complaints, diagnoses, imaging, and treatment plans.\n\nDistinguish between a medical summary and a chronology, and create a clear treatment timeline linking records to the subject incident.\n\nEvaluate medical relevance by identifying injury-related records, noting treatment gaps or missing records, and documenting any impairment ratings supporting damages.\n\nSummarize medical findings clearly and concisely, distinguishing pre-existing conditions from incident-related injuries while avoiding assumptions and unnecessary jargon.\n\nCommunicate findings effectively to the legal team by reporting gaps, missing documents, and key observations needed to support a strong demand letter."
