    "text": "wHAT IS MEDICAL SUMMARY?\n\nit is a narrative explanation of the client’s injuries, treatment, progress, and remaining complaints. It condenses large volumes of medical information into a readable, cohesive story.\n\nKey Characteristics:\n\nNarrative format\nInterpretive (but factual)\nCondensed\nBig-picture focused\nOrganized by topic"
