    "title": "Purpose of the Medical Summary in a Demand Letter",
    "text": "Purpose of the Medical Summary in a Demand Letter\n\nExplains the injury mechanism and connects the incident to the medical findings.\nShows the seriousness of the injuries through key diagnostic and treatment information.\nHighlights persistent symptoms and their impact on daily life.\nSupports general damages (pain, suffering, emotional distress).\nClarifies long-term consequences such as impairment, disability, or need for future care.\nProvides a persuasive, humanized narrative, which is critical for settlement negotiations."
