    "title": "What Is Medical Chronology?",
    "text": "wHAT IS Medical Chronology?\n\nIt is a strict timeline of every relevant medical event, organized by date. It is a structured, itemized list of treatment encounters.\n\nKey Characteristics:\n\nDate-driven:\nObjective:\nDetailed but concise:\nComprehensive\nUseful for spotting patterns:"
