    "title": "Purpose of the Medical Chronology in a Demand Letter",
    "text": "Purpose of the Medical Chronology in a Demand Letter\n\nValidates the timeline of injuries and treatment—crucial for proving causation.\nShows consistency of care, which strengthens the claim.\nIdentifies gaps or delays, allowing the legal team to prepare explanations.\nEnsures no treatment is omitted, which could otherwise reduce settlement value.\nHelps calculate medical specials, including outstanding bills, liens, and future costs.\nActs as a reference tool for attorneys when drafting arguments and negotiations."
