    "title": "4. History of Present Illness (HPI)",
    "text": "4. History of Present Illness (HPI)\n\nHow the injury developed: mechanism, onset, location, severity, progression.\nPurpose: Establishes causation, context for complaint, and aggravating/relieving factors.\n\n5. Review of Systems (ROS)\n\nSystematic checklist of symptoms across body systems.\nPurpose: Confirms additional symptoms, shows comprehensive evaluation.\n\n6. Physical Examination\n\nObjective findings: range of motion, swelling, tenderness, neuro checks, vitals.\nPurpose: Provides objective evidence of severity; supports diagnostics and functional limitations."
