    "title": "Understanding Medical Records",
    "text": "understanding medical records\n\nUnderstanding medical records is fundamental to effectively extracting information, especially when preparing a Medical Summary for a personal injury case. Medical records document your client’s health history, treatments, and care provided. Knowing how to read and interpret these records allows for accurate, organized, and meaningful extraction of relevant data."
