    "text": "Key Components of Medical Records\n\nImaging and Test Reports\nResults from X-rays, MRIs, blood work, and other diagnostic tests.\nOften summarized with normal/abnormal findings, helping highlight key issues.\n\nSurgical and Hospital Records\nDetails of surgeries, admissions, and discharge summaries.\nCrucial for understanding past procedures and outcomes.\n\nBilling-Related Information\nMay include ICD-10 codes (diagnosis) and CPT codes (procedures).\nThese codes are essential for understanding how care was billed and can support case documentation."
