    "title": "Evaluating a Counteroffer",
    "text": "Evaluating a Counteroffer\n\nCONSIDER:\n\nStrength of liability\nQuality and consistency of medical treatment\nJurisdictional tendencies\nPolicy limits\nClient’s goals and risk tolerance\nLitigation costs vs. settlement delta"
