    "img": "slides/day5/13.webp",
    "title": "Drafting Demand Response Reply",
    "text": "Drafting Demand Response Reply\n\nWhen replying:\n\nStay professional and factual\nDirectly address each disputed issue\nAttach only relevant supplemental exhibits\nRe-anchor value with facts, not emotion\nClearly state your new demand or position\nSet a reasonable deadline"
